            <title>[IGNITE-10390] BPlusTree#isEmpty() does not release root page</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10390</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;long&lt;/span&gt; rootId, rootPage = acquirePage(rootId = treeMeta.rootId);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The acquired page is never released. Corresponding tests should be added.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
